, 111.14, 111.26], ["it.", 111.26, 111.4], ["So", 111.7, 111.94], ["now,", 111.94, 112.44], ["you", 112.7, 112.82], ["don't", 112.82, 112.94], ["have", 112.94, 113.06], ["to", 113.06, 113.12], ["treat", 113.12, 113.26], ["dust", 113.26, 113.44], ["mites", 113.44, 113.64], ["like", 113.64, 113.76], ["invisible", 113.76, 114.06], ["roommates", 114.06, 114.48], ["you're", 114.48, 114.68], ["stuck", 114.68, 114.86], ["living", 114.86, 115.04], ["with.", 115.04, 115.22], ["You", 115.4, 115.5], ["may", 115.5, 115.6], ["not", 115.6, 115.74], ["be", 115.74, 115.88], ["able", 115.88, 116.02], ["to", 116.02, 116.14], ["see", 116.14, 116.3], ["them,", 116.3, 116.48], ["but", 116.62, 116.72], ["now", 116.72, 116.9], ["you", 116.9, 117.04], ["can", 117.04, 117.2], ["capture", 117.2, 117.52], ["them.", 117.52, 117.74], ["Black", 117.9, 118.08], ["Friday", 118.08, 118.48], ["is", 118.48, 118.76], ["on.", 118.76, 119.02], ["Up", 119.26, 119.32], ["to", 119.32, 119.5], ["12", 119.5, 119.96], ["free", 119.96, 120.48], ["cards", 120.48, 121.0], ["save", 121.0, 121.34], ["up", 121.34, 121.52], ["to", 121.52, 121.66], ["79%.", 121.66, 122.74], ["Tap", 122.74, 123.16], ["below", 123.16, 123.48], ["to", 123.48, 123.66], ["see", 123.66, 123.82], ["how", 123.82, 123.98], ["capture", 123.98, 124.3], ["cards", 124.3, 124.72], ["work.", 124.72, 124.94]], "segments": [[0.0, 3.34, "Don't buy another dust mite product until you hear this. Let me ask you something."], [3.98, 8.06, "Actually, let me ask you three things. Okay, first, what would you do if you found a snake in your"], [8.06, 11.82, "house? You call somebody to catch it and get it out of there, right? I mean, you wouldn't just say,"], [12.16, 16.72, "well, I guess I live with a snake now. Of course not. You get rid of it. Okay, second question."], [17.0, 20.9, "What if you found bugs crawling around in your bed? What would you do? You'd spray them,"], [21.12, 24.64, "you kill them, you'd clean everything up and get them out of your bed. What do you do when"], [24.64, 29.88, "you find out there are dust mites living in your bed? Well, you capture them and get rid of"], [29.88, 34.46, "them too, right? Oh wait, you can't because you can't even see them. So what are you supposed"], [34.46, 39.1, "to do? Well, that's the problem. You basically just accept it. You say, okay, I guess dust"], [39.1, 42.6, "mites live in my bed now. And instead of getting rid of them, you just try to make living with"], [42.6, 46.6, "them a little easier. You wash your sheets in hot water, you vacuum more often, you running"], [46.6, 51.08, "air purifier, you take antihistamines, maybe you buy a special mattress cover. And listen,"], [51.28, 55.32, "maybe some of that helps. But you're still basically saying, you guys can stay in my bed."], [55.46, 59.12, "I'll just keep dealing with everything around you because really, what other choice do you"], [59.12, 62.78, "have? You can't see them. You can't catch them. So you just lend a lid with them. Well,"], [63.04, 66.66, "what if I told you that's not true? What if you could capture dust mites? What if you"], [66.66, 70.32, "could trap them, pick them up and throw them away just like you would with any other pest?"], [70.74, 74.42, "Well, now you can. These are called capture cards and the way they work, it's actually"], [74.42, 78.06, "pretty caught on. Scientists discovered that dust mites use chemical signals called"], [78.06, 81.88, "pheromones to find one another. One of those signals is called narrow propionate."], [82.04, 86.26, "To a dust mite, that signal basically says, hey, other dust mites are over here."], [86.26, 90.14, "Capture cards use that signal as a lure. So instead of sitting there and hoping a dust"], [90.14, 94.88, "mite accidentally walks onto the card, the card draws them toward it. The mites follow the signal,"], [95.1, 99.16, "they move toward the card. And once they're inside, an adhesive layer traps them so they"], [99.16, 103.1, "can't call back out. You just place the cards near your mattress and pillows as directed,"], [103.34, 107.94, "and let them work. No sprays, no insecticides, nothing to plug in. Then when it's time"], [107.94, 111.4, "to replace the card, you pick it up and throw it away, mites and all. Back to it."], [111.7, 114.68, "So now, you don't have to treat dust mites like invisible roommates you're"], [114.68, 117.74, "stuck living with. You may not be able to see them, but now you can capture them."], [117.9, 124.94, "Black Friday is on. Up to 12 free cards save up to 79%. Tap below to see how capture cards work."]]}